# an upgrade (1.3.0): a piece never changed takes today's recipe; one you changed keeps your settings.
# tests/host/proj-1.2.0*.bin are 1.2.0's own saves (made by its project code: every piece its 1.2.0 recipe; the second
# with Basic's Stabs set by hand to 77)
storefile tests/host/proj-1.2.0.bin
reboot
wait 500
expect format 17
expect piece 0
# Basic as 1.3.0 has it (Stabs 30, Feedback 62; 1.2.0's were 30 and 60), its noise Vinyl
expect par28 30
expect par11 62
expect par4 30
turn PRESET 3
wait 300
expect piece 3
# Fog too (its chord 50, its kick's Density 70)
expect par0 50
expect par116 70
turn PRESET -3
storefile tests/host/proj-1.2.0-basic-changed.bin
reboot
wait 500
# Basic changed by hand: kept as it was (its Stabs 77, its Feedback still 1.2.0's 60); Fog, untouched, today's
expect par28 77
expect par11 60
turn PRESET 3
wait 300
expect par0 50
# a 1.3.0 test build's save (format 14, every piece its recipe then), and the same converted and saved again as 15
# (its first values that build's recipe, the new ones today's): today's recipe either way
storefile tests/host/proj-1.3.0-test14.bin
reboot
wait 500
expect format 17
expect par11 62
expect par29 8
storefile tests/host/proj-1.3.0-test14-resaved15.bin
reboot
wait 500
expect par11 62
expect par29 8
